            <ArticleTitle>Renal colic and torsion: case report and review.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1702-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Acute ureteric colic and acute scrotum are among the most commonly seen urological emergencies. We present a case in which a male patient presented with simultaneous right flank pain and ipsilateral scrotal pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
